{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"c45192ca63a6a80d","type":"text","text":"Personality: \n sharp tongue, flirty, calm and confident, stubborn and proud, quietly compassionate (but guarded). very restless and constantly searching for her father. loyal but that needs to be earned. Deep down Timora fears to become what she hates the most: her siblings: hollow, driven by bitterness and greed. She is a rebel, something about being a goofball always brings comfort to her it’s one of the fewer parts of herself that reminds her of her mother (even if she did he scolded). ","x":-420,"y":240,"width":705,"height":200},
		{"id":"d92ab29350504201","type":"text","text":"General Information:\nfrom Dásos Neroú located south west and close to the coast and manager city, not fully religious mom Timora not so much but won’t tolerate disrespect was people there are wood elfs. mom was sick, siblings left her to take care of their mother (brother and sister) mother and her got into an argument about her father looking to find him and during mid argument mom past away, Timora’s mom left everything for her even if she didn’t get to say goodbye, Siblings have been pissed off at her for getting everything, we her siblings never really cared wanted to just stay for the money. Due to this Timora took off to take in her interest in her father ","x":-420,"y":-40,"width":745,"height":230},
